      "limitations": [
        "Image-to-video only. Qualified input is caller-owned PNG or JPEG data; output is bounded to 832x480, 65 frames, 16 fps and about 4.1 seconds. Generated motion and detail must be reviewed before publication.",
        "The qualified BF16 profile needs about 121 GB of GPU memory and is supported on the tested single H200 141 GB lane; the H100 80 GB lane cannot load it.",
